{"type": "item", "run_id": "20261029T014635Z-routine", "option": "routine", "item_id": "121708d3c295fb2d2a9ca949", "title": "[AINews] Anthropic ends Coding Interviews: \"Hunger beats tenure\"", "url": "https://latent.space/p/ainews-anthropic-ends-coding-interviews-hunger-beats-tenure/", "source": "Latent Space", "published": "2026-10-28T08:50:30+00:00", "is_ai": 0.98, "worthiness": 0.73, "worthiness_confidence": 0.77, "final_score": 0.73, "bucket": "high", "full_text": true, "content_source": "feed_full_text", "text_chars": 46240, "delivered": true, "summary": "Anthropic's hiring manager Felix Rieseberg announced the company stopped using coding interviews, arguing Claude now outperforms humans at coding tasks, making traditional assessments obsolete. He advises junior engineers to prioritize business impact, build ambitious prototypes over weekends, and leverage fresh perspective over credentials. This matters because it signals how frontier AI labs are reshaping hiring: technical gatekeeping via coding challenges becomes less predictive when AI handles implementation. The key takeaway: demonstrate impact through working prototypes, not interview performance.", "jev_ms": 216.5, "jev_input_tokens": 11847, "jev_cost": 0.000497574, "llm_ms": 2832.8, "llm_cost": 0.012689, "errors": []}
{"type": "item", "run_id": "20261029T014635Z-routine", "option": "routine", "item_id": "ec733f799e1aaee3d1ac15d7", "title": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe and Granary v2: Intelligent Multilingual Transcription You Can Prompt and Adapt", "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-transcribe-granary", "source": "Hugging Face - Blog", "published": "2026-10-28T14:58:17+00:00", "is_ai": 0.99, "worthiness": 0.8, "worthiness_confidence": 0.82, "final_score": 0.8, "bucket": "high", "full_text": true, "content_source": "article_fetch", "text_chars": 16445, "delivered": true, "summary": "NVIDIA released Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe, an open-weight model handling transcription, speaker attribution, translation, and audio Q&A across 40 languages with natural language prompting. It ranks first among open-weight models on Hugging Face's ASR leaderboard (5.33% WER) and David AI's diarization benchmark (18.26% DER across 21 languages), using only 4B active parameters via Mamba-Transformer mixture-of-experts. Granary v2, an open data pipeline with 463k hours across 48 languages, enables domain adaptation through fine-tuning; a medical case study achieved 45.8% relative WER reduction on held-out speakers. Developers can deploy locally on RTX GPUs or use hosted endpoints from Baseten and DeepInfra.", "jev_ms": 148.5, "jev_input_tokens": 4520, "jev_cost": 0.00018984, "llm_ms": 4046.6, "llm_cost": 0.005283, "errors": []}
